{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Accessory"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Accessory"}," is most commonly present in older ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},", which requires tens of thousands of crew. Basic Slave Circuits reduces the crew requirements of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," by 1/3, and Advanced Slave Circuits reduces it by 2/3. The crew requirement for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," is never reduced to less than 1- only certain exceptional and custom-built Slave Circuits are capable of such a feat, such as those guiding the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Katana"]}," Fleet. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Quality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Quality","referenceId":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," that has Slave Circuits is still based on its remaining crew.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recall Slave Circuits:"]}," Available only for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," equipped with Advanced Slave Circuits, Recall Slave Circuits allow a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," to be summoned by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," to the owner even when no one is aboard the ship. A ship piloted by it's Recall Slave Circuits can only lift off, fly directly to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," used to summon it, and land at that location- it can take no other actions. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Quality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Quality","referenceId":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284"}," of a ship under the control of Recall Slave Circuits is Untrained (+0 check modifier), and anyone in the pilot's position can disable the Recall Slave Circuits as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
